    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/32bee34ec81d094765b45aa86e09ad93.avif?t=1729520319\" /></div><br><br>PolyCore Defense is a classic tower defense game that is all about the right decisions. In order to succeed you need to pick the right turrets and place them at the most optimal locations. Upgrade your turrets with modules to destroy your enemies faster and counter their abilities. The maps increase in difficulty with shorter and increased number of paths. Can you beat them all?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/b4da72f117ed60ebda7dce6cd2bd564a.poster.avif?t=1729520319\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/b4da72f117ed60ebda7dce6cd2bd564a.webm?t=1729520319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/b4da72f117ed60ebda7dce6cd2bd564a.mp4?t=1729520319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/a03e52d7826cc57e363b188570080e56.avif?t=1729520319\" /></div><br>Use your imagination to build an effective line of defense against waves of enemies with increasing difficulty. Pick and place turrets from your arsenal. Upgrade turrets with modules that enhance them with unique effects. Activate abilities in clutch situations or when you need a little defensive boost.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/5cd88e83dacb44ef4748e3f0c312d7c5.poster.avif?t=1729520319\" ><source src=\"https://shar