 the ultimate challenge!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/77256e9405e9e6120f226fecdc15b32d.avif?t=1729520319\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/9c3309f5bf556cda07f9a461614970cc.avif?t=1729520319\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526930/extras/e6208379476f82e9581bb2429dbf8c1b.avif?t=1729520319\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Strategic </strong>gameplay<br></li><li> Lots of <strong>unique turrets</strong><br></li><li> Loads of <strong>modules</strong> to <strong>upgrade turrets</strong> in unique ways<br></li><li> Unlockable <strong>abilities</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Leveling</strong> system<br></li><li> <strong>Endless mode</strong>, how long will you last?<br></li><li> <strong>Perks</strong> for long term progression<br></li><li> <strong>Various enemies</strong> with different effects<br></li><li> Steam <strong>Achievements</strong><br></li><li> Steam <strong>Leaderboard</strong><br></li><li> Gameplay <strong>Stats</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Challenging</strong> maps<br></li><li> Complete maps without losing any health to ace them for increased challenge</li></ul>",
